00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.506
I'll wave instead.

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:41.441
So it's broken. Is it?

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.710
Are you wave again after recovery here.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.911
Our fellow was torn apart

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.746
by an explosion.

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:47.747
One of ours?

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.816
Yes. That's all that's left of him

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.719
in my eyes.

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.490
Get him in there.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.958
Get him in. Higher.

00:00:58.958 --> 00:01:00.326
Watch his head.

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:01.494
I'm getting out.

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:02.729
I'm getting out now.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.198
The 300 is in the armored vehicle.

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.734
Get out! Get out now!

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:09.602
They'll take care of him.

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:12.639
Okay, guys, let's skedaddle.

00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:15.075
In the middle of a field, a video just

00:01:15.075 --> 00:01:16.309
