00:01:16.309 --> 00:01:18.478
That's Roman's video of what happened.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:19.579
What it's like right now

00:01:19.579 --> 00:01:20.213
in that moment

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.614
on the front lines of a war

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.616
