00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.271
A lot in the south

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.240
with the counteroffensive operation here

00:01:48.308 --> 00:01:48.975
The missions

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:50.310
extremely dangerous,

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:52.946
