00:02:21.541 --> 00:02:22.075
This video

00:02:22.075 --> 00:02:24.210
purporting to show a Russian combat

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.846
helicopter taking out a Ukrainian vehicle

00:02:29.449 --> 00:02:30.083
The Ukrainian

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.518
say Russian interceptor

00:02:31.518 --> 00:02:33.353
