who asked us to hide his face

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.597
and use only his callsign jus tells me

00:02:45.098 --> 00:02:46.499
you can be like a maverick.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:47.634
But to this,

00:02:47.634 --> 00:02:49.302
without the proper

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:51.538
