00:03:16.329 --> 00:03:18.331
We are flying simulators.

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:22.402
So at the moment we have like improvised

00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:26.206
simulators of F-16 almost all the bases

00:03:27.941 --> 00:03:28.775
