00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:37.750
Both Alexi

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:38.785
Squadron Leader

00:03:38.785 --> 00:03:40.787
and his wingman killed in combat,

00:03:40.787 --> 00:03:41.521
