00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.590
When you see the explosion

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.258
of your colleague

00:03:45.692 --> 00:03:48.995
your eyes in real time, oh,

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:52.532
it's a it's a shock to

00:03:53.566 --> 00:03:53.800
it.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.102
It's a shocking picture

00:03:56.102 --> 00:03:59.372
and is a really big, um,

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:03.042
difficult in this situation.

00:04:03.042 --> 00:04:04.077
It's

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:06.246
how to

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:08.548
how to sit in an aircraft again.

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:09.983
Again, and again and again.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:11.251
But when

