00:09:32.972 --> 00:09:34.340
to people

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.709
who haven't done anything to him,

00:09:36.709 --> 00:09:40.212
to normal Russian citizens, to ordinary

00:09:40.212 --> 00:09:41.180
Ukrainian citizens.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.648
He's killing people.

00:09:42.648 --> 00:09:45.585
He's threatening people here.

00:09:45.585 --> 00:09:46.953
He's asking people

00:09:46.953 --> 00:09:48.788
to move out of different countries.

00:09:48.788 --> 00:09:52.458
And I want him to stop

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:54.660
and I want his government to stop

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.463
what they're doing, surrender and

00:09:58.497 --> 00:10:01.000
to stop this horrifying war.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:01.734
All right.

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:04.370
Well, Dasha, I'm glad to see you again

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.037
one of these times.

00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:06.205
I hope it will be under very different,

00:10:06.205 --> 00:10:07.073
different circumstances.

00:10:07.073 --> 00:10:08.774
But thank you so much for sharing this

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:09.075
and making

00:10:09.075 --> 00:10:09.575
sure everyone knows

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:10.576
what's happening to your father.

00:10:10.576 --> 00:10:11.310
Thank you for having me.

